  EC2 -->|TypeORM/PostgreSQL| DB[(PostgreSQL productivo)]
  EC2 -->|HTTPS API| SG[SendGrid<br/>Correo transaccional]
  EC2 -->|HTTPS API opcional| Gemini[Google Gemini AI]
  Dev[Equipo de desarrollo] -->|Git push| GH[GitHub Repositories]
  GH -->|Build/deploy frontend| CDN
  Dev -->|Version bundle| S3[S3 bucket de versiones EB]
  S3 -->|Application version| EB

